58-df-well-order.md\">../batch20/58-df-well-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,R,\\pi,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(X,R,\\pi,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span> (well-ordered set, collapse map, and ordinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalCollapseMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalCollapseMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WellOrder}\">\\(\\operatorname{WellOrder}\\)</span> (well-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" href=\"?note=1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-well-order.md\">../batch20/58-df-well-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injection}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\)</span> (injection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalCollapseMap}_S(\\pi,X,R,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,R)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,X,\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Injection}_S(\\pi,X,\\alpha)\\land\n\\left[\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(\\pi(x)=\\beta)\\right]\\land\n\\left[\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land x\\neq y)\\leftrightarrow\\pi(x)\\in\\pi(y)\\bigr)\\right]\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalCollapseMap}_S(\\pi,X,R,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,R)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,X,\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Injection}_S(\\pi,X,\\alpha)\\land\n\\left[\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(\\pi(x)=\\beta)\\right]\\land\n\\left[\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land x\\neq y)\\leftrightarrow\\pi(x)\\in\\pi(y)\\bigr)\\right]\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WellOrder}\">\\(\\operatorname{WellOrder}\\)</span> is reflexive, whereas ordinal membership is strict. The collapse therefore compares <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span> with the strict part <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\setminus\\Delta_X\">\\(R\\setminus\\Delta_X\\)</span>; comparing all of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> would make every nonempty instance inconsistent.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{